    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "number": 4,
      "heading": "Caramelise the onions",
      "blocks": [
        "Melt butter in a wide pan over medium-high heat. Add onion, a splash of cold water and a pinch each of salt and sugar. Cook 18–20 minutes until soft and caramelised."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
