      "number": 6,
      "heading": "Glaze and warm",
      "blocks": [
        "Drizzle the glaze over the nearly cooked sausages and add the buns to the tray. Return to the oven 2–3 minutes to warm the buns."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
